    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Deficiency of N-acetylgalactosamine-6-sulfatase enzyme activity plus characteristic clinical features or pathogenic GALNS gene variants",
    "notes": "Diagnosis may be supported by elevated urinary keratan sulfate but this is not definitive alone."
